Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunacchi!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The scar that Oden left on me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why does it hurt?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did the blade pierce my body?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are they using Oden's Ryuo?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it pierce through to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you joined \Nhands with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumor about the shadows\Nat the ruins of Oden Castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zou the Phantom Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind it all was the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,By a curious coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys were hiding behind the Straw Hats\Nwho I see as my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of you held out for 20 years\Nwhile others jumped forward and ran around,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and you ended up gathering all your troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But pirates will stab you in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are insulting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0} is nothing like you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Kaido, the officers, Orochi,\Nand all your subordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kick all your asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the man\Nwho will stand at the pinnacle of the sea someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we die, he will still be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Daybreak will come to the Land of Wano again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...that is what we promised our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be an all-out war!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Battle Under the Moon!\NThe Berserker, Sulong the Moon Lion!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just what I'd expect from Ace's brother!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm happy to fight alongside him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We held out for 20 years and \Nfinally made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to be afraid of now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it kills you, \Ncling onto Kaido's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0} and the others' support,\Nwe finally get to face you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We will not let you get out of here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have several hundred troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right. Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 30,000 soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do with only several hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's an emergency!\NThousands of intruders are entering from the back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! If that's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice you as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you guys are screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A samurai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro-{\i1}dono{\i0}! We'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Point B inside the castle!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The samurai troops joined \Nup with Roronoa Zoro!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Point C!\NThe samurai who got caught in the Flower Capital...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the Udon prisoners are rampaging, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...Gibson!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, don't fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for clearing \Nthe way for us this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only here to take Kaido's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get in my way,\NI won't spare any of you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Amputation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chambres!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pirates that Kin'emon-{\i0}dono{\i1} brought...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're so dependable!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this all about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A former Warlord, Law, has arrived as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all united and gaining strength!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--{\i1}Queen-{\i0}sama{\i1}!{\i0}\N--There's more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the entrance of the island,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Marco the Phoenix\Nand Perospero are fighting together...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey! What happened?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.27,0:10:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy Maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they teaming up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the ogre extermination begins-{\i1}yoi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn every single member of\Nthe Animal Kingdom Pirates into a Candyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco and Perospero teamed up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,First Babanuki, then Kyoshiro, and now this?\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You drunk bastards across Onigashima!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonight's banquet has been called off!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pick up your weapons!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's an enemy raid!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though Kaido's gone,\Nthere are still three Lead Performers there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I know there'll be a chance!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Momonosuke-{\i0}sama{\i1}!\NPlease wait just a little longer...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Win the Land of Wano back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kick my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! I accept your challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the world's \Ngreatest military power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! I'll catch up to you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally sobered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna have a deadly fight,\Nit's better out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanna do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...is cut off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What a funny man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden Two-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Paradise Totsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Paradise Totsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But unlike that day, Oden's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something else is different from that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We deduced that when you turn into a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be able to fight in the dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how much\NI've been looking forward to this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to learn\Nhow angry we are the hard way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Minks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:16:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought the warriors from our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a snow flurry in a clear sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can clearly see the full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You Minks turn into berserkers called Sulongs\Nby the full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you did \Nthis, you damn samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fault we let so many of you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never come near Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0} again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you-{\i1}gara{\i0} guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack is our sworn enemy\Nwho devastated our thousand-year-old kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We told him countless times\Nthe samurai wasn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, give him to us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have a warrior from the Land of Wano\Nnamed Raizo here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior from the Land of Wano? Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know such a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the warrior from the Land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this go even if I die, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the day I curse you-{\i1}gara{\i0}\Nto death with my cat-grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The warrior who they said wasn't there\Nis me, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved my life!\NI'll pay you back many times over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a score to settle with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to pay for it with your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--No, Master and your fellow samurai...\N--...must prepare for Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Duke-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll leave them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll use every bit of my strength\Nto take down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:45.07,On Top,,0,0,0,,RODDY AND BB, WHALE FOREST GUARDIANS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:51.04,On Top,,0,0,0,,GIOVANNI, SHISHILIAN, AND CONCELOT\NDOGSTORM THREE MUSKETEERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid! A Sulong's \Nlifespan is short!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! We're beasts, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:06.18,On Top,,0,0,0,,NANGI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.69,0:22:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up with me, Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about your-{\i1}gara{\i0} self, Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:21.60,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no time to lose as Momonosuke gets weaker.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,Shinobu tries to help, \Nbut is attacked by King.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.01,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luffy and the others desperately defend themselves\Nagainst threats from Big Mom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemies build their momentum!\NCan Nami, left alone, get out of a dire situation?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Zeus' Treason?! The Cornered Nami!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.15,0:23:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:48.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,
